Maybe I'm missing something, but so far this game for me as been:
- islands are all the same;
- loot is very unbalanced;
- towns are all the same;
- most enemy ships don't even try to fight back;
- I've heard every single cliché Pirate talk that ever existed, every other 20 seconds;
- music was... well, let's just say I hadn't muted the sound of a game since ever.
I gave up on exploring islands. I gave up on going to cities. I gave up on picking up the poo.
